  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP: Law and Order Trust Fund (LOTFA)  (Successor phase)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Law and Order Trust Fund for Afghanistan for support to civilian security sector.  Continuation of AFG-09/028.
This phase consists of two Projects;
1)  the Support to Payroll Management Project (SPM) providing full MOIA payroll management by December 2016. 
2) developing national capacity (MOIA and Police Development) for self-sustained reform and improvement of the MOIA as an institution, and the police services as instruments for citizen safety and maintenance of rule of law.</narrative>
  </description>
